      "text": "we'll begin with sterile saline irrigation, 2 litres, continuous, until pH neutral it's for chemical eye burn i am washing the eye now, keep it open and do not stop cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference i'm going to send a a referral to the eye emergency service come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse let's review you straight away"
